<title>NETHERLANDS: Bank Labouchere 1996 net almost doubles.</title>
<headline>Bank Labouchere 1996 net almost doubles.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to end-Dec 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    37.68 vs  19.05</p>
<p>    Pre-tax operating profit	  47.29 vs  30.80</p>
<p>    Tax				     13.74 vs  10.50</p>
<p>Net extraordinary gain after tax 5.32 vs  NIL</p>
<p>    Attrib to minority interests     1.19 vs  1.26</p>
<p>NOTE - Bank Labouchere is a fully-owned banking subsidiary of insurer Aegon</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
